    {
      "ja": "30MMエグザビークルシリーズに3段階の変形が楽しめる「小型可変機Ver.」が登場！",
      "en": "Introducing the \"Small Variable Vehicle Ver.\" which allows you to enjoy 3 stages of transformation in the 30MM Exa Vehicle series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• エグザマクスモード、固定砲台モード、移動砲台モードの3形態に完全変形。",
      "en": "• Completely transforms into 3 modes: Examination mode, fixed turret mode, and mobile turret mode."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腕部に回転ギミックを搭載。用途に合わせてフレキシブルに変形。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a rotating gimmick on the arm. Flexible and transformable to suit your needs."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの30MMシリーズの武器を持たせられる。",
      "en": "• Can be equipped with 30MM series weapons (sold separately)."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• カスタマイズの幅を広げる「30MMフレーム」B型ランナーが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with a \"30MM frame\" B-type runner that expands the range of customization."
